OL,3,GNEWSAComputer error leads to 'extremely
OL,4,Ascary' swim
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man is taking on an "extremely scary"
OL,7,Fswim after his wife accidentally
OL,8,Fselected the longest distance for a
OL,9,Fcharity challenge.
OL,11,FMike Thorpe, from the village of
OL,12,FFyfield in Wiltshire, will be one of 50
OL,13,Fswimmers swimming six miles (9.65km) as
OL,14,Fpart of the Swim Serpentine at Hyde
OL,15,FPark in London on Saturday.
OL,17,F"My wife hit the wrong button on the
OL,18,Fcomputer," he admitted. "She meant to
OL,19,Fhit the one-mile option for six people,
OL,20,Fbut ended up booking the six-mile
OL,21,Foption for one person."
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
