OL,3,GNEWSAComputer error leads to 'extremely
OL,4,Ascary' swim
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite the error, Thorpe, aged 57,
OL,7,F"put his hand up" and has spent the
OL,8,Fpast four months training for the
OL,9,Fchallenge.
